[{"client_msg_id":"B0BED6C1-C711-4F6A-9FEF-CCD9E90D29A0","type":"message","user":"UFYACJ537","text":"どっちがどう違うのかまったく分からないけど凄そう…！","ts":"1621039274.407300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UIK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c06b6977-d5e3-4118-966d-34be1bfb77f8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おお","ts":"1621038046.406400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z8nbm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1208909-ad1a-4672-a4c9-1794779949b8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"すごい","ts":"1621037675.406200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SQCoA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11801aec-2345-4785-8655-32148121ca9f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"便利な coc エクステンションがあったら Language Server 化して機能を固めれば他のLSPクライアントでも coc の「ぱわー」を使えるので良いかもしれないです。(ちなみに僕は coc メインで使っていますが)","ts":"1621037668.406000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["UFP0GQZ4K","U01TQP86UM6"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nGchY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01b41ee0-badd-4ecb-8db8-e201d229c66a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"もうひとつは coc-sql という SQL用の coc extension (非Language Serverな拡張) があるのですが、それを Language Server 側に機能を載せて固めたって感じです。 \u003chttps://github.com/yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server\u003e","ts":"1621037657.405700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server","id":1,"title":"yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server","title_link":"https://github.com/yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server","text":"[Expelmental and Study] Implemented fannheyward/coc-sql features in the language server. - yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/833de1f0e9e432c5fd7a5cbc26adfd2a97ede377e84f573cd6357546cec196b6/yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server","original_url":"https://github.com/yaegassy/fann-sql-language-server"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aSYU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fc0f7d0-2751-498c-bcba-82e5c1c31c34","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"習作としてSQL用の Language Server を2つ作ってみました。LSPの Node/TypeScript 実装の `vscode-languageserver` と Python実装の `pygls` を使って linter, formatter, code acitonを。1つは sqlfluff という linter, formatter があったのでそれ用のと。 \u003chttps://github.com/yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server\u003e","ts":"1621037645.405400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server","id":1,"title":"yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server","title_link":"https://github.com/yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server","text":"[Expelmental] A sql language server exclusively for sqlfluff and coc.nvim extension - yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/17c6b5bf2df8adf70e658d84b3a86b9f216d39ed3a7f2ef7e03d1695b593c88c/yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server","original_url":"https://github.com/yaegassy/sqlfluff-language-server"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M6LJ"}]}]
